      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18389/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix brown sugar, cinnamon, and nutmeg together in a bowl. Spoon half of the sugar mixture into each apple.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c-9dFgzur0dB9XQpd2EEkdfU9Ak=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18389-MicrowaveBakedApples-mfs-Step2-0410-2c43dec43701451fa14f14e3ac0f53f5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18389/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put 1 teaspoon butter on each top and place apples in a deep, microwave-safe casserole dish and cover.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZqXeBPsxvOnm7F-1d2Wd2g_L67I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18389-MicrowaveBakedApples-mfs-Step3-hhhh0413-13ab30f9e17e4a1093e034e0a2267b74.jpg"
